title: selective highlighting
pid: 4dff56e9-2838-4530-969b-0f82b9f77feb
body: |2-
  Reading with selective collection is valid.
  Collect (duh) what most needs further processing.
  Collect it into an "intended reading" list.

  Highlighting is less disruptive to reading than editing --
  and if interruptions to write more of them them
  are meaningfully preventing you from reading your notes,
  you're probably processing information inefficiently.
